    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After charting a new course mid-journey with a coaching change, the trailblazing franchise saw its bold pathfinder, John Tortorella, pioneer a flawless finish. This decisive coaching performance fueled their march through the hockey frontier, culminating in a series sweep that allowed them to arrive at the ultimate frontier of the Stanley Cup Final.",
